{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[Db]Now, Dear Lord, as we [Ebm7]pray,
take our [Ab7]hearts and minds far [Db]away
From the [Bbm]press of the world all [Ebm]around
to your [Ab]throne where grace does [Db]abound.
May our [Gb]lives be transformed by Your [Db]love,
may our [Bbm]souls be re[Eb7]freshed from [Ab]above.
At this [Db]moment, let people every[Ebm7]where
join us [Ab7]now as we come to You in [Db]prayer.
{end_of_verse}
